Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,main,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:16.86,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,Princess Mirika, please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.91,0:00:23.01,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,Well, it is her first date \Noutside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.01,0:00:24.50,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,I guess I can't blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:29.32,main,WRIGHT,0,0,0,,Master Gurion has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:30.58,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:31.88,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:35.21,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Yes, Laura?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:37.14,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,Why is she putting on airs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:39.89,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,Master Kunon Gurion has arriv—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.43,0:00:42.98,main,WRIGHT/RIFF,0,0,0,,Oh, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:46.27,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:49.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The moon is beautiful tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:52.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can't see it, but I hope it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:55.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Since it is our first night out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:57.60,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Oh, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:01:02.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I was the princess at school, \Nbut I will escort you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:05.92,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Princess, your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.18,0:01:07.92,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.91,0:01:17.65,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,So that's Master Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:27.85,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,KUNON THE SORCERER CAN SEE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:54.52,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,QUITE A BOY AND A NEW MASTER
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:53.77,main,RESTAURANT OWNER,0,0,0,,Welcome to my restaurant, Master Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:03:00.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Here's to the beautiful blue \Nof your eyes and your dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:05.43,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,Gentlemanly poise and behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:08.66,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,No wonder he stole \NPrincess Mirika's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:11.74,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,So you visited the Black Tower today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.74,0:03:15.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. Starting with your \Nbig sister, Lady Raysha,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:17.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,every one of them was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:20.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The magical power of Grand\NMaster Blue Cheese especially
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:22.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,was just like your full coiffure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:23.49,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:25.55,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,Is that the right metaphor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:27.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I passed the test as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:31.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I haven't heard who my \Nmagic teacher will be,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:35.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but I'm sure they'll arrange it nicely,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:38.95,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,just like your sharp nails with \Nbeautiful colors and shapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:43.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I've listened to so many \Ninteresting stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:45.64,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh. Of course {\i1}your{\i0} stories,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:50.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,which sparkle like bird-repelling charms \Nswinging in the wind on a wheat field,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,are more engaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:58.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hm. This meat is quite refreshing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:01.22,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,What exactly is "refreshing meat"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:09.47,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,He is a bit strange, \Nbut Princess Mirika looks happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.23,0:04:14.25,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:17.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Right now, a dinner like \Nthis is the best I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:27.13,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But when we get married, we'll spend \Ntime together like this every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.67,0:04:34.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can't wait for the future where \NI'll be walking by your side to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:35.73,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,I take back what I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:40.71,main - italics,LAURA/I,0,0,0,,Kunon Gurion... He's quite a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.10,0:04:41.97,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:58.15,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you need \Nto go to bed already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:08.77,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:13.41,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Could I ask for your help?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:16.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-rubu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:22.69,main,IKO,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.69,0:05:25.09,main,IKO,0,0,0,,This gets the dirt off really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:27.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I was in the middle of writing a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:29.81,main,IKO,0,0,0,,This won't do, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:34.23,main,IKO,0,0,0,,You've been shutting yourself in your \Nroom since you returned from the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:36.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I want to write it down before I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:40.16,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Going outside and spending \Ntime in the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:44.09,main,IKO,0,0,0,,is one of your important jobs as \Na child. It can affect your growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:48.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So women prefer tall men, after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.97,0:05:51.41,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Some do, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:56.41,main,IKO,0,0,0,,But I like you, Master Kunon, \Nwhether you're tall or short.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.41,0:05:57.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:05:59.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I also like...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.01,0:06:02.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oops, I shouldn't say that, since I don't \Nwant to be rude to Princess Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:04.44,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:07.39,main,IKO,0,0,0,,You're such a ladies' man \Nfor making me say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:18.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,By the way, did a letter ever come for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:20.09,main,IKO,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.51,0:06:22.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So they haven't decided yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.49,0:06:23.57,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Decided what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:25.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,My teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:28.66,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.53,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:34.58,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,I'd rather not go...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.47,0:06:46.59,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,I hope I can come back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:52.85,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Mr. Zeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:06:59.62,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:04.14,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:10.15,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Victo. Don't you dare interfere \Nwith my precious sleeping time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.15,0:07:12.68,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,This is why I didn't want to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:15.28,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:17.16,main,VICTO,0,0,0,,The Grand Master is calling for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.53,0:07:19.72,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,The old-timer is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:22.29,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:25.29,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko, my new teacher has been assigned!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:26.77,main,IKO,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.77,0:07:28.39,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:32.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Um, Ze-oh-n-ly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:35.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Zeonly Finroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:38.68,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The person Brother and \NMother were talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:42.37,main,IKO,0,0,0,,{\i1}The{\i0} Master Zeonly, who is rumored to \Nbe a magnificently gorgeous sorcerer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.37,0:07:43.46,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You know him, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:44.61,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Of course, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:47.32,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Every woman in Hughlia knows him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:48.89,main,IKO,0,0,0,,What do I do, what do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:52.42,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I need to ask for a new maid \Noutfit from your father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:53.95,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I have to put on makeup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:56.10,main,IKO,0,0,0,,What do I do, what do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:56.90,main - top,KUNON,0,0,0,,Showing my beautiful \NIko to some other man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.06,main - top,KUNON,0,0,0,,Jealousy will drive me crazy—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:00.34,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Sorry, Master Kunon.\NI don't have time for that now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.34,0:08:02.42,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh no, I need to do my nails!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:03.93,main,IKO,0,0,0,,And my hair, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.93,0:08:05.22,main,IKO,0,0,0,,And lose weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:07.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.42,0:08:19.00,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to ask you this all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:21.98,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,but I guess I don't need to apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.52,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,No, Sister Raysha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:28.11,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Inconvenient, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.39,0:08:33.46,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,A Royal Sorcerer must have a direct \Norder from royalty to go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:37.29,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Guarding me should be a \Ngood enough reason, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:40.12,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Yes. Anyhow...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:42.30,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Why did that man get chosen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:46.18,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,I wanted to be Kunon's teacher, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.91,0:08:51.21,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Sister Everille, Sister Lydalia...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:53.38,main,EVERYL,0,0,0,,Oh, who was this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:57.39,main,LYDALIA,0,0,0,,I hear your fiancé has\N an impressive reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:59.63,main,LYDALIA,0,0,0,,Your fiancé only.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:03.15,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Yes. He's an excellent sorcerer,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.15,0:09:06.44,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,but that has nothing to do with you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:10.02,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:16.26,main,EVERYL,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky, Second Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.85,0:09:19.66,main,LYDALIA,0,0,0,,You were reprimanded by \Nthe knight three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:20.91,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Why do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:27.29,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Never mind them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.29,0:09:29.82,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Right. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.14,0:09:31.79,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.79,0:09:35.05,main,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,Again, why did that man get chosen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:48.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I wonder what my teacher is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:09:59.20,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:00.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:04.16,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Did I surprise you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:09.36,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I mentally prepare \Nmyself every time I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:13.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Seeing you unexpectedly,\N I'm lost for words from being nervous
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:15.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,since you're too adorable and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:19.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Like a frog that's being\N stared down by a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:23.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But I can't see, so I don't know \Nwhat it's like to be stared down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.72,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,That brat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.45,0:10:28.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh? Did you change your perfume?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:31.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It feels mature and it's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:35.60,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,They tell me I'm too young for perfume,\N so I don't have any on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:37.49,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I did change my soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.49,0:10:38.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.78,0:10:41.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It has a mature yet floral scent,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:45.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,so I'm a butterfly drawn \Nto a flower right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:54.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So you are Zeonly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:11:00.22,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:02.85,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,His magical power is so dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:06.33,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It's not just dense. It's sticky as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:08.87,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It's almost like honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.87,0:11:11.85,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,A completely different type of magical \Npower than Grand Master Blue Cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.27,0:11:15.30,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,He's more proficient in magic\Nthan any of the Royal Sorcerers
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:17.03,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,that I met at the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.79,0:11:21.15,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon? Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.86,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I want to look up to him as my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:28.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please excuse me. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:29.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:32.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I know it's out of the blue,\N but may I call you Teacher Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:34.67,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Uh? Piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:36.88,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then what shall I call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:38.57,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Master Zeonly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.57,0:11:39.88,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Make sure to add "master."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:42.95,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Listen well. I hate brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:45.43,main - italics,IKO/I,0,0,0,,What a foul mouth! But so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:49.68,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,And I didn't accept the position \Nof your magic teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.19,0:11:52.37,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,It's not like I wanted to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:55.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're here because of the \Nties of the rigid hierarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.35,0:11:57.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's life, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:12:02.58,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,That old-timer Londimonde told me there \Nwas an interesting brat I should meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:05.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Grand Master Blue Cheese \Nsent Teacher Honey to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:07.95,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's with those names?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:09.45,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.91,0:12:12.60,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,I'm Dario Sanz, a knight\Nof the Third Order,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:15.58,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,here to guard Her Highness and Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:18.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh! Thank you for \Neverything the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:20.78,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.78,0:12:23.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. Not that I personally know him,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:27.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but I was the frog stared down by \Nthe snake three times with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.53,0:12:29.60,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,That was my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.02,0:12:31.60,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,What a strange kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.27,0:12:36.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,By the way, Master Zeonly is the \Nmagnificently gorgeous sorcerer, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:38.13,main,IKO,0,0,0,,That is correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:39.78,main,IKO,0,0,0,,He's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:41.34,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:42.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:47.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Since I can't see, I don't understand \Nwhat's cool, but you must be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:52.12,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You're kind of making \Nfun of me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.36,0:12:54.27,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.99,0:12:56.59,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,What a strange kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.89,0:13:04.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So you brought Master Zeonly here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:06.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:10.26,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Not at all. I wanted to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.26,0:13:13.68,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Likewise, my pretty princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:15.87,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:17.19,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I'm here too, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:21.69,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Stop flirting and let's have a fun \Ndiscussion about magic with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:22.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:26.62,main - italics,DARIO/I,0,0,0,,That face says he wants to \Nhave fun picking on the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:28.65,main - italics,IKO/I,0,0,0,,And that face looks so gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.03,0:13:32.74,main - italics,DARIO/I,0,0,0,,But it's your master he's going to tease.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.65,0:13:35.61,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You know compound spells, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:39.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Spells are released from a magic \Ncircle drawn with magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:44.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Compound spells are created by dividing \Nand rearranging magic circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:46.22,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,How many sections can you handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:49.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can do... 31 sections.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:50.10,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:54.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can go up to 32, but sometimes I fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:57.22,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Not too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:14:00.31,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Me, I can go up to fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.31,0:14:02.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Fifty sections?! That many?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:03.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,How do you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.48,0:14:07.74,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,What I'd like to know is how you \Ngot past the twenty-section hurdle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:09.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I layered crests.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:12.92,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,And you got there on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:15.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. And I used a bunch of little tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.41,0:14:21.88,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,"Little tricks" apparently gives a bad \Nimpression, so I call them alterations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:23.63,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,Is he for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:27.54,main - flashback,VICTO,0,0,0,,Why you, Mr. Zeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:30.29,main - flashback,VICTO,0,0,0,,I wanted to be his master, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:35.38,main - flashback,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,You couldn't be bothered to meet \Nhim when he came here. Not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:39.13,main - flashback,VICTO,0,0,0,,No, not fair! I want him, \NI want him, I want him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:38.16,main - flashback - top,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm going because I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.16,0:14:40.47,main - flashback - top,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,The old-timer says he's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.47,0:14:41.93,main - flashback,VICTO,0,0,0,,He's not just interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:44.51,main - flashback,VICTO,0,0,0,,An excellent student like him \Nwon't come around too often.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:49.31,main - flashback,RAYSHA,0,0,0,,He goes zoom! And then goes bouncy bounce!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.31,0:14:50.45,main - flashback,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:55.29,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,I can see why they were so \Ninvested in getting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:58.87,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,He is an exceptional talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:03.04,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,All right, show me what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:05.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But show me how to\N do fifty sections first!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:08.36,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,It's pointless to teach it \Nto someone who can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:10.68,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna waste my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:15.03,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Prove what you can do and ask \Nfor instruction fair and square
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.03,0:15:17.02,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,by sucking up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.45,0:15:21.27,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,Kunon would never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:24.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Master Zeonly, you're so cool.\N Please teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.99,0:15:27.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd love to see how awesome you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:29.15,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,He totally did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.15,0:15:33.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And I'd love to see your generosity, \Nkindness, tenderness,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:37.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and that lonesome profile you \Nshow every now and then!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:38.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Well, I really can't see any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.89,0:15:42.20,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Sucking up to you isn't a problem if it \Nmeans I can learn how to do 50 sections!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:43.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Let me suck up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.99,0:15:48.02,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I have many things to say to you, \Nbut first of all, don't call me master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:50.37,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I haven't acknowledged you yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.37,0:15:53.43,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,but I'll show you how awesome I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:56.68,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,My three-star crest of earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:58.77,main,IKO,0,0,0,,How amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:03.00,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Try to destroy this wall with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.00,0:16:04.94,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Otherwise, that's it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.55,0:16:07.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,With magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:14.98,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,And I hear your water bed is popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:15.95,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:19.20,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:27.77,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Let me observe from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:29.21,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Try to do your best...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:34.95,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,What is this softness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:37.87,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,It's like a pile of down feathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.71,0:16:40.47,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,It's not just soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.47,0:16:45.90,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,It's warm and smells so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:47.80,main - italics,ZEONLY/I,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:52.51,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,He fell asleep?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:54.74,main,IKO,0,0,0,,You can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:04.36,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It's so hard, and yet smooth to the touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:07.06,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Very simple at first glance,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:10.37,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,but the density of magical \Npower is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:14.26,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It's strong enough to sustain \Nthe hardness over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:17.01,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Magic is a crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.01,0:17:19.27,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,A crest means a magic circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:24.67,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,The caster creates various spells by \Nrearranging different magic circles,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.67,0:17:28.94,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,and those magic circles become \Nthe base of each spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:31.15,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Compound magic refers to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:35.33,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,the number of times the base magic circle \Nhas been divided and reconstructed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:37.28,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,and it's the essence of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:43.45,main - flashback,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,This number shows the level \Nof magic, and alterations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:48.55,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,It's a crystal of compound \Nmagic with over forty sections.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:53.30,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,This is amazing. How can one \Nincrease the sections this much?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.14,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.69,0:17:58.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your Highness, let's have a chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:17:58.91,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:02.67,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.67,0:18:06.04,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. Let's wait until \NMaster Zeonly wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:07.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Might as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:08.57,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:11.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I can destroy it in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:24.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Did you sleep well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.65,0:18:25.87,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,How long was I asleep for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:28.01,main,DARIO,0,0,0,,About two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.01,0:18:30.13,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I was totally asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:35.38,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Yo, kid. You look awfully comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.65,0:18:37.00,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Did you give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:40.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No. Are you ready for me to break it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:44.14,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Uh? Sure, if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:46.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-rubu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:55.29,main,IKO,0,0,0,,That's what he used for laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:19:00.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's a dirt wall, which \Nbecomes extremely fragile
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:02.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,when it absorbs water beyond its capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:05.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I could tell right away\N because the texture
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.21,0:19:07.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,was very similar to that of the hard bread
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.39,0:19:09.16,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,meant for breaking teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:12.87,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You got it more or less right except \Nfor the purpose of hard bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:15.13,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,But why did you use A-rubu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:18.42,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Your specialty is A-ori, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:20.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.86,0:19:26.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I thought this would be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:32.22,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Rather than using force, you saw the \Nwall as dirt and chose to wash it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.71,0:19:33.72,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.25,0:19:36.94,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,There are spells that're compatible \Nwith certain situations and subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.58,0:19:41.10,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,A sorcerer's job is to see through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.10,0:19:42.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You complimented me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.33,0:19:44.20,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Does that mean I can be your student?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:45.99,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You don't get to decide that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:51.80,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Kunon Gurion. Starting today,\Nyou are a student of Zeonly Finroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:54.63,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You're the luckiest kid in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:57.71,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,because I am going to be your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.89,0:20:00.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:04.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I found my master, and Princess \NMirika is by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.55,0:20:07.16,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If I wished for any more,\N I'd get a divine punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:09.60,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Oh, Kunon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.60,0:20:11.17,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:14.57,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Just so you know, your master \Ncomes before your fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:15.31,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:19.15,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Now that you're my student,\Nthere's a ton of things for you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:23.45,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I have a million things to teach you, \Nand you'll help with my experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.45,0:20:25.42,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.42,0:20:28.45,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,And what will you do, Miss Fiancée?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.78,0:20:29.54,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.63,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,He's {\i1}my{\i0} student now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:34.33,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,He'll improve a whole lot, \Nand move up in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:38.55,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,And soon, women will swarm \Naround him to fight over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.99,0:20:43.09,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,You get what I'm saying, \NMiss Ninth Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:46.34,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,He is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:51.85,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,Kunon has grown so much to become \Na student of a Royal Sorcerer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.77,0:20:57.38,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,but I'm still a princess of low status.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.14,0:21:05.59,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,If I don't do something, there's no \Nfuture where Kunon and I can be together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:10.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Master! Please don't be \Nmean to Her Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:11.62,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.91,0:21:14.02,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I'm actually rooting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.02,0:21:18.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You say that, but you actually like \Nbeing mean to girls, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:18.75,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.75,0:21:21.63,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And you're the type to \Nrealize it too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.63,0:21:24.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're the type to be \Nmean to a girl you like
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:27.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and have her stolen from under your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.51,0:21:32.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're the difficult, awkward \Ntype who can't be kind to girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:35.14,main - italics,IKO/I,0,0,0,,Awkward, but still cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.72,0:21:37.69,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Hey, brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.69,0:21:39.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, Teacher Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.53,0:21:41.62,main,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Don't call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.62,0:21:42.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:51.26,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,I have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.86,0:21:53.01,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,I have to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.70,0:23:40.25,main - top,SIGN {top},0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE:\NINCREDIBLE TRAINING AND INCREDIBLE RESULTS
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.89,0:23:39.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next episode: "Incredible \NTraining and Incredible Results."
